{"2902740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Draw Steel", "steam_appid": 2902740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new role-playing game for a new age! <strong><i>Draw Steel</i></strong> is the breathtaking new, action-oriented, fantasy RPG from MCDM that’s both fun to play and fun to run! A game about heroes, heroes who stop the villains, save the villagers, rescue beautiful dragons from ravening princesses. <strong>Draw Steel</strong> heroes worry about monstrous villainy and perfidious treachery, not spell slots or armor class. <br><br><strong>Draw Steel</strong> includes everything you need to create and play your own adventures together online. Including tools for building your own maps with dynamic lighting, line-of-sight, multiple levels, and you can import maps from your own map collection! <br><br>Includes all the core rules from the <strong><i>Draw Steel: Heroes</i></strong> and <strong><i>Draw Steel: Monsters</i></strong> Hardcovers, as well as, <strong><i>The Delian Tomb - Start Here Adventure</i></strong> to get you and your party running the game quickly. <br><br>Suitable for both new and seasoned TTRPG players, <strong>Draw Steel</strong> was designed and tested around a Director with 3-6 players, but is flexible for parties both larger and smaller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902740/extras/339071bc81137869100514014a10fd96.avif?t=1783975969\" width=1200 height=620 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new role-playing game for a new age! <strong><i>Draw Steel</i></strong> is the breathtaking new, action-oriented, fantasy RPG from MCDM that’s both fun to play and fun to run! A game about heroes, heroes who stop the villains, save the villagers, rescue beautiful dragons from ravening princesses. <strong>Draw Steel</strong> heroes worry about monstrous villainy and perfidious treachery, not spell slots or armor class. <br><br><strong>Draw Steel</strong> includes everything you need to create and play your own adventures together online. Including tools for building your own maps with dynamic lighting, line-of-sight, multiple levels, and you can import maps from your own map collection! <br><br>Includes all the core rules from the <strong><i>Draw Steel: Heroes</i></strong> and <strong><i>Draw Steel: Monsters</i></strong> Hardcovers, as well as, <strong><i>The Delian Tomb - Start Here Adventure</i></strong> to get you and your party running the game quickly. <br><br>Suitable for both new and seasoned TTRPG players, <strong>Draw Steel</strong> was designed and tested around a Director with 3-6 players, but is flexible for parties both larger and smaller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902740/extras/339071bc81137869100514014a10fd96.avif?t=1783975969\" width=1200 height=620 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Draw Steel brings the tabletop RPG hit to steam with a fantasy RPG that’s both fun to play and fun to direct! A game about heroes who stop the villains, save villagers, and rescue beautiful dragons from dark dungeons. Suitable for both new and seasoned TTRPG players.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902740/3eac7cf21486a9fa855f39111f54246a3e3d3cca/header.jpg?t=1783975969", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902740/e6fb9e7782aa1f0ee0e2cdb4d1409c350355ec72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783975969", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902740/e6fb9e7782aa1f0ee0e2c